WEBVTT

00:33.687 --> 00:36.962
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.437 --> 00:39.800
=Episode 9=

00:39.950 --> 00:42.512
(Lord Wei Is Beyond Your Reach)

00:43.320 --> 00:46.000
Serve the court well from now on.

00:46.120 --> 00:47.879
I would not dare
fail His Majesty's grace.

00:49.080 --> 00:50.000
Rise.

00:52.320 --> 00:53.240
Careful.

00:59.440 --> 01:00.239
Eunuch,

01:00.320 --> 01:01.160
please, come inside.

01:01.160 --> 01:01.839
Have some tea,

01:01.839 --> 01:03.079
have some pastries.

01:03.800 --> 01:04.960
No need for the trouble.

01:05.280 --> 01:06.160
Lord Wei,

01:06.960 --> 01:08.079
His Majesty said,

01:08.079 --> 01:10.679
in view of your contributions
to Great Yong,

01:10.679 --> 01:13.800
you are specially exempted from
entering the palace to give thanks.

01:16.159 --> 01:18.560
After the edict is delivered,
do not let him enter the palace.

01:18.840 --> 01:20.719
This fool's mouth is too infuriating.

01:20.840 --> 01:22.280
I do not wish to see him.

01:22.520 --> 01:23.320
Yes.

01:25.880 --> 01:27.039
I don't have to see His Majesty?

01:27.920 --> 01:30.320
I was planning to present
my salt-making method

01:30.320 --> 01:31.960
to leave a good impression
as a son-in-law.

01:32.759 --> 01:33.560
Eunuch,

01:34.119 --> 01:35.159
let's discuss it.

01:39.000 --> 01:40.039
What's wrong?

01:40.280 --> 01:41.079
It hurts.

01:43.079 --> 01:43.880
Hao,

01:44.000 --> 01:45.679
it's my fault.

01:45.960 --> 01:47.599
I was too heavy-handed.

01:48.079 --> 01:49.040
I'm splitting the household.

01:51.079 --> 01:52.159
Hao, be good.

01:52.280 --> 01:53.120
No splitting.

01:53.120 --> 01:54.120
Go lie down inside for a while.

01:54.120 --> 01:55.519
I'll apply medicine
for you myself later.

01:57.079 --> 01:57.519
Go.

01:57.519 --> 01:58.159
Young Master.

01:59.239 --> 02:01.120
- Greetings, Lord Wei.
- Greetings, Lord Wei.

02:03.079 --> 02:03.519
Good,

02:03.959 --> 02:04.760
good, all of you.

02:05.000 --> 02:06.000
Reward them, reward them all.

02:06.000 --> 02:07.599
- Thank you, Lord Wei.
- Thank you, Lord Wei.

02:07.599 --> 02:08.239
Yes.

02:08.319 --> 02:09.560
Today, the residence gives rewards.

02:09.799 --> 02:11.920
Before, Hao was almost
a laughingstock of West City.

02:11.920 --> 02:13.239
But today he's been granted a title.

02:13.319 --> 02:15.200
From now on,
no one will dare bully our family.

02:17.400 --> 02:18.200
(Ganlu Palace)
Your Majesty,

02:18.200 --> 02:20.000
I have received news.

02:20.239 --> 02:22.400
That shop which was sealed earlier

02:22.400 --> 02:24.439
was privately manufacturing gemstones.

02:24.920 --> 02:25.760
By all rights,

02:26.239 --> 02:28.799
these gemstones
are equivalent to currency.

02:28.799 --> 02:31.159
Not only can they circulate
within Great Yong,

02:31.280 --> 02:32.560
even in Beicang,

02:32.560 --> 02:33.879
and the Western Regions,

02:33.879 --> 02:35.400
they can be used in circulation.

02:35.840 --> 02:39.200
If the method of making gemstones
is taken under the Ministry of Revenue,

02:39.560 --> 02:40.920
then the ministry's shortfall

02:40.920 --> 02:42.560
can be resolved at once.

02:43.840 --> 02:45.079
This method,

02:45.200 --> 02:48.120
I am afraid it cannot be handed
to the Ministry of Revenue.

02:49.920 --> 02:50.400
Why...

02:50.840 --> 02:51.680
Why?

02:52.240 --> 02:53.280
These gemstones

02:53.599 --> 02:55.479
were produced by the royal family.

02:57.879 --> 02:58.919
To be precise,

02:59.159 --> 03:00.919
they were made by Ning'an.

03:02.800 --> 03:06.000
These gemstones were made
by Princess Ning'an?

03:06.960 --> 03:09.800
No wonder that day in court,

03:10.520 --> 03:12.280
Princess Ning'an dared
to confront Beicang directly.

03:12.960 --> 03:14.080
So Her Highness

03:14.319 --> 03:15.960
was already confident.

03:16.120 --> 03:17.439
Now it all makes sense.

03:19.599 --> 03:20.919
Princess Ning'an

03:21.159 --> 03:22.240
has rendered

03:22.240 --> 03:24.319
a great service to Great Yong.

03:24.479 --> 03:25.280
Should we

03:25.599 --> 03:26.960
announce it to the world

03:27.039 --> 03:29.120
and promote the prestige
of the royal family?

03:29.599 --> 03:31.319
This matter must not be publicized.

03:31.919 --> 03:34.840
These gemstones are still
of great use against foreign states.

03:35.280 --> 03:36.120
All of you,

03:36.520 --> 03:37.879
must keep this strictly confidential.

03:38.800 --> 03:41.080
- This subject obeys the decree.
- This subject obeys the decree.

03:43.479 --> 03:44.159
By the way,

03:44.479 --> 03:45.319
Fuji,

03:46.520 --> 03:48.759
where did you hear

03:48.759 --> 03:50.680
about the private manufacture
of gemstones?

03:52.479 --> 03:53.800
Silence

03:54.759 --> 03:55.639
him.

04:11.520 --> 04:12.199
Behave.

04:12.560 --> 04:14.039
Once you're in here,
don't even think of leaving.

04:17.879 --> 04:18.719
By His Majesty's order,

04:19.479 --> 04:21.560
he is not to speak with anyone.

04:21.599 --> 04:22.280
- Yes.
- Yes.

04:30.625 --> 04:31.250
(Wei Mansion)

04:31.280 --> 04:32.759
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

04:32.759 --> 04:34.120
Good.

04:34.280 --> 04:35.800
Congratulations, Lord Wei.

04:35.800 --> 04:36.919
Congratulations.

04:36.919 --> 04:37.879
Alright, thank you.

04:38.000 --> 04:39.280
Thank you, everyone.

04:39.280 --> 04:40.680
The people of West City

04:40.680 --> 04:42.360
have all received kindness
from your father.

04:42.360 --> 04:43.759
If Wei the Good returns,

04:43.759 --> 04:45.159
he would surely be overjoyed.

04:45.800 --> 04:46.520
Come.

04:46.520 --> 04:48.680
These two hens are for Lord Wei
to nourish himself.

04:48.680 --> 04:50.240
Alright. Thank you.

04:50.439 --> 04:51.240
(Wei Mansion)
That's right.

04:51.639 --> 04:54.080
This time you've really
brought honor to the Wei family.

04:54.080 --> 04:55.520
- Congratulations, congratulations.
- Greetings, Clan Leader Wei.

04:55.520 --> 04:56.439
Greetings, Clan Leader.

04:56.439 --> 04:58.199
Congratulations.

04:58.520 --> 05:00.680
Thank you.

05:00.680 --> 05:01.360
Clan Leader,

05:01.439 --> 05:02.240
please come inside.

05:03.160 --> 05:03.759
Alright.

05:06.560 --> 05:07.160
Lord Wei,

05:07.160 --> 05:08.519
this is a small token from our family.

05:09.040 --> 05:11.079
Later tonight, everyone
come dine at Juxian Restaurant.

05:11.079 --> 05:12.079
Congratulations.

05:12.079 --> 05:13.240
Juxian Restaurant is excellent.

05:13.240 --> 05:13.759
Congratulations.

05:13.759 --> 05:15.360
We'll bring our families along
when the time comes.

05:15.360 --> 05:18.639
I have come today especially
to offer my congratulations.

05:19.480 --> 05:20.920
Our Wei clan

05:21.160 --> 05:23.519
has finally produced a titled lord.

05:24.319 --> 05:25.639
I also offers congratulations
to the Clan Leader

05:25.639 --> 05:26.680
and to the Wei clan.

05:28.120 --> 05:29.160
Wei Hao,

05:30.279 --> 05:31.079
Wei Hao.

05:32.839 --> 05:33.439
Quick,

05:33.439 --> 05:34.639
bring the Young Master over.

05:35.160 --> 05:38.000
In the future, we hope Lord Wei
will lend us more support.

05:42.319 --> 05:43.040
You all continue chatting.

05:43.040 --> 05:44.079
Be sure to come tonight.

05:44.079 --> 05:45.120
Of course.

05:45.240 --> 05:46.560
Alright.

05:47.079 --> 05:48.040
Wei Hao,

05:48.560 --> 05:51.560
last time I was truly forced

05:51.560 --> 05:54.000
by the pressure
from the other clan elders,

05:54.120 --> 05:56.720
and had no choice but to drive
you out of the ancestral home.

05:57.199 --> 05:58.079
This time,

05:58.480 --> 05:59.879
I have come in person

05:59.879 --> 06:02.759
to bring you and Madam Lin Luo back.

06:04.279 --> 06:05.720
I'm not going back.

06:12.480 --> 06:14.439
I know you're upset,

06:16.560 --> 06:17.439
but

06:18.199 --> 06:20.680
there is something you must understand.

06:21.480 --> 06:24.319
All these years,
the clan's care for your family

06:24.360 --> 06:25.800
cannot be ignored.

06:26.800 --> 06:29.959
If not for the clan's
protection back then,

06:30.040 --> 06:33.040
your father could never have become
the richest man in West City.

06:33.040 --> 06:34.079
Your restaurant

06:34.079 --> 06:36.680
would have long
been taken by other forces.

06:37.879 --> 06:38.879
Now,

06:39.360 --> 06:41.040
you hold the rank of Count.

06:41.040 --> 06:43.959
You should return
to the clan and serve its people.

06:48.560 --> 06:50.360
And you still
have the nerve to say that?

06:52.199 --> 06:53.240
Aside from making my father

06:53.240 --> 06:55.160
hand over money
to support others in the clan,

06:55.800 --> 06:56.959
what have you ever done for him?

06:58.240 --> 06:59.439
You call that protection?

06:59.439 --> 07:00.399
That's exploitation.

07:00.920 --> 07:02.600
When my aunt and I had no value,

07:02.600 --> 07:03.360
you drove us out.

07:03.360 --> 07:05.639
Now that I've been granted a title,
you want me back?

07:05.639 --> 07:07.160
Do we look that easy to bully?

07:08.000 --> 07:09.839
How is that bullying?

07:10.959 --> 07:11.759
Hao,

07:12.000 --> 07:13.240
the Clan Leader means

07:13.240 --> 07:15.240
we should move back
to the Wei ancestral home.

07:15.439 --> 07:16.519
I'm not going back.

07:17.519 --> 07:18.120
You...

07:19.879 --> 07:22.759
Then the imperial edict for your title,

07:23.120 --> 07:25.439
could I take it back

07:25.560 --> 07:27.800
and place it in the Wei ancestral hall?

07:30.759 --> 07:32.240
In your dreams.

07:32.759 --> 07:34.120
Clan Leader,
if you push your luck any further,

07:34.120 --> 07:35.319
believe it or not, I'll hit you.

07:35.920 --> 07:37.000
Wei the Fool,

07:37.480 --> 07:39.319
how dare you be so disrespectful to me?

07:40.000 --> 07:40.759
Stop, Hao!

07:40.759 --> 07:41.879
I am the Clan Leader!

07:41.879 --> 07:42.720
Leave at once.

07:42.879 --> 07:43.759
Clan Leader?

07:44.040 --> 07:45.199
What kind of Clan Leader are you?

07:45.920 --> 07:46.920
You're exactly the one I should hit.

07:46.920 --> 07:47.920
You fool.

07:47.920 --> 07:49.759
I won't let you off.

07:51.560 --> 07:52.360
Hao.

07:53.000 --> 07:53.800
Young Master.

07:54.759 --> 07:56.120
You've offended Clan Leader Wei.

07:56.120 --> 07:57.600
We really won't be able to go back now.

07:57.720 --> 07:59.120
That shabby place,
not going back is fine.

07:59.120 --> 08:00.639
We have money and land now.

08:00.639 --> 08:02.480
I'll build myself a modern residence.

08:02.639 --> 08:03.279
Mo...

08:03.959 --> 08:04.959
Mo...

08:05.199 --> 08:06.040
Modern?

08:08.120 --> 08:09.120
I need to plan it properly.

08:09.759 --> 08:10.759
One thousand five hundred mu.

08:14.800 --> 08:15.600
What...

08:18.519 --> 08:20.279
(Juzhen Glaze Workshop)
I just got you out of prison,

08:20.279 --> 08:21.319
and you don't even say thank you.

08:21.319 --> 08:22.240
You come asking for things right away.

08:22.240 --> 08:23.160
Do you have any conscience?

08:23.160 --> 08:24.360
You provoked the Imperial Guards.

08:24.360 --> 08:25.720
It had nothing to do with me.

08:25.959 --> 08:26.759
Besides,

08:26.759 --> 08:28.319
weren't you the one
who told me to come today?

08:28.920 --> 08:29.720
Fine.

08:30.279 --> 08:31.079
Fine.

08:31.079 --> 08:31.879
Stop.

08:32.399 --> 08:33.879
We're not packing glaze
for them anymore.

08:35.480 --> 08:36.279
These

08:36.800 --> 08:37.800
are all reserved for me.

08:37.800 --> 08:38.560
No.

08:44.319 --> 08:45.680
I misspoke just now.

08:45.680 --> 08:47.040
You're broad-minded and magnanimous.

08:47.040 --> 08:47.439
You wouldn't

08:47.439 --> 08:49.360
hold it against
a young woman like me, right?

08:51.920 --> 08:52.720
Profit-seeker.

08:55.120 --> 08:56.319
Come, keep going.

08:56.680 --> 08:57.959
Come on, hurry, help out.

08:58.000 --> 08:58.959
Careful.

09:00.199 --> 09:01.160
Careful, take it slow.

09:01.639 --> 09:03.399
Last time you refused to sell to me.

09:03.480 --> 09:05.360
Why are you willing to leave
these kilns for me this time?

09:05.360 --> 09:06.160
Didn't you say

09:06.240 --> 09:07.879
you wanted
to take all of Beicang's money?

09:08.040 --> 09:09.160
That's why I decided to help you.

09:10.319 --> 09:12.360
What does that have to do with anything?

09:12.439 --> 09:13.720
I just like

09:13.720 --> 09:15.080
helping others achieve their dreams.

09:15.600 --> 09:16.159
You wouldn't understand.

09:16.720 --> 09:17.519
Do you get it?

09:19.080 --> 09:20.799
Now that we've finally reopened,

09:20.799 --> 09:21.440
this stock

09:21.440 --> 09:23.879
is all being taken away
by those Beicang merchants.

09:27.039 --> 09:27.879
Many thanks, Young Master Wei.

09:27.879 --> 09:29.159
(Not calling me a fool anymore?)

09:29.600 --> 09:30.639
Come, be careful.

09:31.000 --> 09:32.480
Lay down some straw
and soft bedding underneath.

09:32.480 --> 09:33.000
And here as well.

09:33.000 --> 09:33.480
Good.

09:33.937 --> 09:34.399
(Baozheng Hall)

09:34.399 --> 09:35.200
Clan Leader,

09:35.759 --> 09:38.440
recently Wei the Fool's glaze workshop

09:38.440 --> 09:39.600
has been making a great deal of money.

09:40.000 --> 09:41.600
Why haven't we heard

09:41.840 --> 09:42.960
(Wei clan elder)
that he's been handing

09:42.960 --> 09:46.039
over half the earnings
to the clan as per the rules?

09:46.159 --> 09:47.679
Forget sharing profits,

09:47.879 --> 09:50.600
even when I went to his house
to congratulate him on his title,

09:50.600 --> 09:52.480
he drove me out.

09:52.480 --> 09:53.799
He shows no respect for his elders.

09:53.799 --> 09:54.679
Completely improper.

09:54.679 --> 09:56.440
A complete fool.

09:59.039 --> 10:01.080
Now that he has a count title,

10:01.720 --> 10:02.919
the Wei family's officials

10:03.000 --> 10:05.679
have also lost a Supervising Secretary
in the Ministry of Revenue.

10:06.240 --> 10:07.039
Clan Leader,

10:07.480 --> 10:08.559
have we found out

10:08.919 --> 10:11.720
who Wei Cong offended?

10:14.080 --> 10:16.440
The court is ever unpredictable.

10:16.919 --> 10:19.519
Who knows what foolish thing he did

10:19.519 --> 10:21.080
to offend someone important?

10:22.919 --> 10:23.720
Clan Leader,

10:23.840 --> 10:25.000
several major families'

10:25.000 --> 10:26.320
representatives in the capital
have arrived.

10:26.399 --> 10:27.559
They have business with you.

10:27.625 --> 10:32.100
(Baozheng Hall)

10:36.080 --> 10:37.679
Since you've all come together,

10:37.799 --> 10:39.279
what is the matter?

10:42.279 --> 10:44.799
(Cui Xiongkai, Cui clan representative in the capital)
There is indeed something to discuss with the Wei clan.

10:49.759 --> 10:50.559
Please, go on.

10:50.960 --> 10:51.919
(Wang Chen, Wang clan representative in the capital)
Clan Leader Wei,

10:52.039 --> 10:53.399
Wei Hao, Wei the Fool,

10:53.399 --> 10:55.559
is a member of your clan, correct?

10:55.639 --> 10:57.600
You know about his glaze workshop,

10:57.639 --> 10:58.759
right?

10:59.159 --> 11:00.039
I know.

11:00.240 --> 11:01.559
Has something happened?

11:02.279 --> 11:03.360
By rights,

11:03.679 --> 11:05.440
it's a good thing that Wei Hao
has created such a workshop

11:05.440 --> 11:07.120
and made a fortune.

11:07.960 --> 11:09.399
Your Wei clan takes the lion's share,

11:09.679 --> 11:11.720
and it's only fair
the rest of us get a cut.

11:12.320 --> 11:14.559
That's how it's always been done.

11:14.559 --> 11:15.440
But now,

11:16.720 --> 11:18.679
Wei Hao won't even let us

11:18.679 --> 11:19.960
have a share.

11:20.919 --> 11:23.039
That's a bit unreasonable, isn't it?

11:25.679 --> 11:26.879
And by rights,

11:27.360 --> 11:28.480
aside from the capital,

11:28.679 --> 11:30.039
the selling rights in other regions

11:30.039 --> 11:32.639
should be shared with us.

11:32.919 --> 11:34.120
Isn't that fair?

11:36.360 --> 11:37.159
Gentlemen,

11:37.480 --> 11:40.320
this is indeed our Wei clan's fault.

11:40.679 --> 11:43.200
But you must have heard in the capital

11:43.200 --> 11:45.240
about my situation with Wei Hao.

11:45.440 --> 11:47.440
It's truly embarrassing.

11:47.440 --> 11:48.279
I

11:48.639 --> 11:50.879
cannot persuade Wei Hao.

11:51.799 --> 11:53.039
When I went to his house,

11:53.399 --> 11:56.919
it was already fortunate that he
didn't chase me out and beat me.

11:56.919 --> 11:57.799
Clan Leader Wei,

11:58.600 --> 12:00.120
so from now on,

12:00.159 --> 12:02.399
your clan will not interfere
in Wei Hao's affairs?

12:03.279 --> 12:04.919
You cannot control him,

12:05.159 --> 12:07.440
and he does not follow
our aristocratic rules.

12:07.600 --> 12:10.159
Either your clan
handles this matter personally,

12:10.159 --> 12:12.559
or leave it to us to deal with.

12:17.120 --> 12:20.039
Wei Hao's workshop is very profitable.

12:20.840 --> 12:22.639
For him alone to control it,

12:25.279 --> 12:26.440
that's hardly acceptable.

12:26.440 --> 12:26.840
Exactly.

12:26.960 --> 12:27.840
That's unfair.

12:27.879 --> 12:28.200
Yes.

12:28.320 --> 12:28.879
Completely improper.

12:28.879 --> 12:29.600
Besides,

12:29.799 --> 12:32.000
he hasn't given
your Wei clan a single coin.

12:32.559 --> 12:33.799
If we decide to deal with him,

12:36.240 --> 12:37.840
you wouldn't object, would you?

12:46.937 --> 12:49.767
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

12:50.387 --> 12:53.787
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

12:54.557 --> 12:57.507
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

12:57.847 --> 13:00.547
♪Sigh and walk away♪

13:02.147 --> 13:05.617
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

13:05.617 --> 13:07.847
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

13:07.847 --> 13:09.957
♪Colors and darkness♪

13:09.957 --> 13:11.977
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

13:11.977 --> 13:16.337
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

13:17.777 --> 13:21.507
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

13:21.777 --> 13:25.377
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

13:25.537 --> 13:27.617
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

13:27.617 --> 13:32.407
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

13:32.627 --> 13:34.247
♪The world mistakes me♪

13:34.247 --> 13:36.587
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

13:36.657 --> 13:37.847
♪As the storm approaches♪

13:37.847 --> 13:40.247
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

13:40.457 --> 13:42.177
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

13:42.177 --> 13:44.157
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

13:44.327 --> 13:46.077
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

13:46.077 --> 13:48.177
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

13:48.177 --> 13:49.647
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

13:49.647 --> 13:51.877
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

13:52.097 --> 13:53.297
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

13:53.297 --> 13:55.817
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

13:55.947 --> 13:57.657
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

13:57.657 --> 13:58.937
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

13:59.087 --> 14:00.507
♪My wish has finally come true:♪

14:00.507 --> 14:01.547
♪To stay by your side♪

14:01.547 --> 14:03.467
♪In this fleeting world♪

14:03.637 --> 14:06.887
♪We are free and happy♪

14:10.887 --> 14:12.667
♪From a nobody♪

14:12.667 --> 14:14.567
♪To someone now famous♪

14:14.677 --> 14:16.107
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

14:16.107 --> 14:18.617
♪But I laugh at how
they cannot see through it all♪

14:18.717 --> 14:20.297
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

14:20.297 --> 14:22.367
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

14:22.577 --> 14:24.257
♪In this vast world♪

14:24.257 --> 14:26.257
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

14:26.407 --> 14:28.617
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

14:28.617 --> 14:30.207
♪Everything ends eventually♪

14:30.297 --> 14:31.797
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

14:31.797 --> 14:34.197
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

14:34.197 --> 14:35.907
♪No matter how time flies♪

14:35.907 --> 14:37.067
♪Even if the falling snow♪

14:37.067 --> 14:38.697
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

14:38.697 --> 14:39.737
♪All I want now♪

14:39.737 --> 14:41.837
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

14:41.837 --> 14:45.097
♪Year after year♪
